                          "$type": "Models.Memo, Models",
                          "Text": "Leaf senescence rate is calculated to ensure that all leaves are senesced by the end of dry-down phase.\n\nThere is no data on detachment rates and so a simple value was chosen to ensure that leaves were not retained in the canopy. In the future, with more data available a thermal time basis leaf detachment rate will be explored.",
